    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>21 or Die Trying. A Card Tactics Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black OX is a turn-based card tactics game where  Tic-Tac-Toe meet Blackjack:</strong> Place cards onto a grid. Create a line\u2014horizontally, vertically, or diagonally\u2014that totals exactly <strong>21</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Deck-Building:</strong> Adapt and enhance your strategy between battles. Purchase powerful <strong>Action Cards</strong>, <strong>Forge Card Abilities,</strong> and <strong>Oxchips</strong> that bend the rules in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/1e735213dead1498d1fde70899871c2a.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/1e735213dead1498d1fde70899871c2a.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/1e735213dead1498d1fde70899871c2a.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Place your cards, make your hand, and take the pot. In Black OX, you don't just play the cards\u2014you play the board. Place cards on a grid to create a line that makes you win. Every round is a duel of wits where a single card can change everything.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/6d77947fbcb6670ac7466b18f9587043.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/6d77947fbcb6670ac7466b18f9587043.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/6d77947fbcb6670ac7466b18f9587043.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic-Tac-Toe with a Twist:</strong> Align your cards in a row, column, or diagonal that <strong>equals 21</strong> to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the Grid:</strong> The board is your battlefield. Use tactical placement to block your opponent while setting up your own winning hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Chip Loadout:</strong> Acquire new Chips to enhance your cards, disrupt your rivals, and control the flow of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/f2a1743b06a90c0746a9bc9d3375313b.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/f2a1743b06a90c0746a9bc9d3375313b.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/f2a1743b06a90c0746a9bc9d3375313b.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend the game to your will with a powerful deck of game-altering cards. Earn or buy Action Cards to control the flow of the match.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Deck:</strong> Craft your deck between battles with unique cards that let you manipulate the board and your Rival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Cards:</strong> Play cards that let you redraw, discard opponent's cards, or modify values on the grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Signature Cards:</strong> Modify your cards with game-changing effects. Force a card to steal points, double its score, or generate cash with every win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Chess Power:</strong> Modify your cards based on Chess pieces, each Chess piece brings a game-changing ability to the board\u2014master them all to dominate.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/df099afdb2e38039fe7f72a5dfa5b91b.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/df099afdb2e38039fe7f72a5dfa5b91b.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/df099afdb2e38039fe7f72a5dfa5b91b.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip over 120 mystical <strong>Oxchips</strong>\u2014powerful artifacts inspired by ancient runes and symbols that grant you persistent buffs and unique abilities. A good hand is one thing, but a powerful loadout is everything.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your Strategy:</strong> Equip chips that grant unique powers, like summoning cards on your first turn or draining your opponent's score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Power:</strong> Each chip has a unique identity. Will you focus on an aggressive gold-hoarding build or a defensive, controlling strategy?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Combinations:</strong> With over 120 chips to find and unlock, you can create thousands of loadout combinations to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Every run is different. Make choices, build your power, and see how far you can climb the criminal ladder. The path you choose determines your fate.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/6deae8d38c25eb6b5e0a70a6b034e3f7.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Card Battler:</strong> The first game to fuse Tic-Tac-Toe, Blackjack, and roguelike deck-building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategy:</strong> Master card placement, betting, buffing, and a vast library of special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Cards:</strong> Modify your cards with game-changing effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 120+ Oxchips:</strong> Discover and unlock game-changing powers for endless strategic variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stylized Visuals:</strong> Features stunning foil, polychrome, and animated card effects that bring the battle to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/665bc36558c3d3732bf38e0ef73233e4.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/665bc36558c3d3732bf38e0ef73233e4.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/665bc36558c3d3732bf38e0ef73233e4.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
