ards, or modify values on the grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Signature Cards:</strong> Modify your cards with game-changing effects. Force a card to steal points, double its score, or generate cash with every win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Chess Power:</strong> Modify your cards based on Chess pieces, each Chess piece brings a game-changing ability to the board\u2014master them all to dominate.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/df099afdb2e38039fe7f72a5dfa5b91b.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/df099afdb2e38039fe7f72a5dfa5b91b.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/df099afdb2e38039fe7f72a5dfa5b91b.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip over 120 mystical <strong>Oxchips</strong>\u2014powerful artifacts inspired by ancient runes and symbols that grant you persistent buffs and unique abilities. A good hand is one thing, but a powerful loadout is everything.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Your Strategy:</strong> Equip chips that grant unique powers, like summoning cards on your first turn or draining your opponent's score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Power:</strong> Each chip has a unique identity. Will you focus on an aggressive gold-hoarding build or a defensive, controlling strategy?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Combinations:</strong> With over 120 chips to find and unlock, you can create thousands of loadout combinations to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Every run is different. Make choices, build your power, and see how far you can climb the criminal ladder. The path you choose determines your fate.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/6deae8d38c25eb6b5e0a70a6b034e3f7.avif?t=1755622719\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Card Battler:</strong> The first game to fuse Tic-Tac-Toe, Blackjack, and roguelike deck-building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategy:</strong> Master card placement, betting, buffing, and a vast library of special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Cards:</strong> Modify your cards with game-changing effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 120+ Oxchips:</strong> Discover and unlock game-changing powers for endless strategic variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stylized Visuals:</strong> Features stunning foil, polychrome, and animated card effects that bring the battle to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/665bc36558c3d3732bf38e0ef73233e4.poster.avif?t=1755622719\" width=300 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/665bc36558c3d3732bf38e0ef73233e4.webm?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643780/extras/665bc36558c3d3732bf38e0ef73233e4.mp4?t=1755622719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
